~ start
Angel: BE NOT AFRAID... Oh, pardon me. Habit.
Angel: Greetings. I am your date. Please sit precisely in the center of your chair. If you tilt three degrees to the left, it upsets my divine alignment.

if GameManager.dev_mode_show_affection:
    - "I respect someone who appreciates neatness and geometry." (+15 Affection)
        do GameManager.add_affection("angel", 15)
        Angel: Ah! A soul of harmony! Perfect 90-degree alignment!
        => main_menu
    - "Relax, a little mess never hurt anyone." (-15 Affection)
        do GameManager.add_affection("angel", -15)
        Angel: *Wings twitch violently* A... a little mess?! Asymmetry is a cosmic corruption!
        => main_menu
    - "Are all those eyes on your wings staring at me?" (0 Affection)
        Angel: They are merely observing the geometric balance of this room.
        => main_menu
else:
    - "I respect someone who appreciates neatness and geometry."
        do GameManager.add_affection("angel", 15)
        Angel: Ah! A soul of harmony! Perfect 90-degree alignment!
        => main_menu
    - "Relax, a little mess never hurt anyone."
        do GameManager.add_affection("angel", -15)
        Angel: *Wings twitch violently* A... a little mess?! Asymmetry is a cosmic corruption!
        => main_menu
    - "Are all those eyes on your wings staring at me?"
        Angel: They are merely observing the geometric balance of this room.
        => main_menu

~ main_menu
Angel: What topic shall we organize into perfect discourse next?

- "Tell me about your obsession with symmetry."
    => symmetry_chain
- "What is your favorite kind of music or sound?"
    => music_chain
- "How do you feel about chaotic or messy rooms?"
    => chaos_interrogation
- "Tell me about your architectural preferences."
    => architecture_lore_check
- "I think that's enough for today."
    => end_date

~ symmetry_chain
Angel: Everything in the universe was designed with sacred ratios. The golden spiral, perfect right angles, twin halo alignment.
Angel: When an object is tilted even half a millimeter, my inner halos vibrate in distress!

if GameManager.dev_mode_show_affection:
    - "I can fix your cutlery so it's perfectly parallel." (+10 Affection)
        do GameManager.add_affection("angel", 10)
        Angel: *Gasp* Parallel to the edge of the table?! You are a divine gift!
        => main_menu
    - "Sounds exhausting." (-10 Affection)
        do GameManager.add_affection("angel", -10)
        Angel: Order is not exhausting! Disorder is chaos!
        => main_menu
else:
    - "I can fix your cutlery so it's perfectly parallel."
        do GameManager.add_affection("angel", 10)
        Angel: *Gasp* Parallel to the edge of the table?! You are a divine gift!
        => main_menu
    - "Sounds exhausting."
        do GameManager.add_affection("angel", -10)
        Angel: Order is not exhausting! Disorder is chaos!
        => main_menu

~ music_chain
Angel: I sing in 7-part harmonic choir frequencies!
You: Do you ever listen to casual pop music?
Angel: Only if the beat is strictly 120 BPM in 4/4 time without polyrhythms.
do GameManager.add_affection("angel", 5)
=> main_menu

~ chaos_interrogation
if GameManager.get_affection("angel") < 35:
    Angel: Your previous answers lacked geometric perfection. I refuse to engage further.
    => main_menu
else:
    You: How do you handle being in an asymmetrical or messy room?
    if GameManager.is_imposter("angel"):
        Angel: Oh, I love messy room chaos! Asymmetry makes spaces feel cozy, cluttered, and alive!
        do GameManager.record_clue("angel", "symmetry_slip", "Claims to love messy, asymmetrical, chaotic rooms.")
        Angel: Who cares if picture frames are crooked?
    else:
        Angel: It causes acute spiritual vertigo! Asymmetry makes my halos ache and my feathers shed!
        Angel: I must straighten every frame and align every chair immediately!
    => main_menu

~ architecture_lore_check
if GameManager.get_affection("angel") < 35:
    Angel: I will not converse with someone who disrupts cosmic harmony.
    => main_menu
else:
    You: What is your ideal living space layout?
    if GameManager.is_imposter("angel"):
        Angel: A curved, organic, irregular cavern with random crooked alcoves!
        do GameManager.record_clue("angel", "building_slip", "Claims ideal living space is an irregular, crooked, curved cavern.")
        Angel: Angles are overrated!
    else:
        Angel: A perfectly cubic room constructed with 90-degree marble pillars and dual mirrored arches!
        Angel: Absolute mathematical symmetry in every dimension!
    => main_menu

~ end_date
Angel: The allocated duration of 180 seconds has elapsed precisely. Farewell for now.
do GameManager.complete_current_date()
=> END
